# AI-Arch color scheme — dark glass / muted cyan (docs/AI-ARCH-DESIGN.md)
# Based on the BreezeDark structure (KDE, LGPL-2.0-or-later).
#
# Palette:
#   background        14,17,20    near-black charcoal
#   surface           22,27,33    dark glass
#   accent            64,190,220  muted electric cyan
#   secondary         96,110,190  subtle blue/violet
#   text              232,236,240 / 140,149,159 (inactive)
#   status            63,185,80 / 210,153,34 / 248,81,73

